# `yo fix <path> --migrate unsized` on v0.2.78 writes each lend `&b` of a
# `Box(Dyn(T))` where a `&Dyn(T)`/`&mut Dyn(T)` is taken as `&b.*` (VERDICTS-40
# §5 family (d), which v0.2.77's mode never wrote; after the flip `&b` lends
# the box and is E0601): at a parameter, a `&mut` parameter and an enum
# payload, a field chain included. A `Box(Dyn(T))` temporary there is listed.
# `main.yo` then type-checks; `temp.yo` keeps its listed site.
fix . --migrate unsized
check main.yo
